cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Wolff Security Scan GAN: SQL Injection Detection in REST APIs with GAN-Generated Payloads"
abstract: >-
  Dynamic application security testing (DAST) tool that detects SQL injection
  vulnerabilities in REST APIs using payloads synthesized by a Generative
  Adversarial Network with LSTM-based generator and discriminator, guided by
  the target API's Swagger/OpenAPI specification.
